{
    "word": "fascine",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                "word": "fascine",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f191573d-6a12-4172-b566-f8c8cb32d763",
                        "entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fascines"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ee6b764-b702-31fe-b37c-b59b4f3dccd6",
                        "entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Originally a cylindrical bundle of small sticks of wood, and now often a bundle of plastic pipes, bound together, and used for strengthening purposes, such as in revetments for riverbanks, and in mats for dams, jetties, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c609716a-fb6f-30d8-8ece-04431e2b7e92",
                        "entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A similar bundle of sticks of wood or plastic pipes used for filling in ditches for armoured fighting vehicles to drive over, and for making parapets, raising batteries, and strengthening ramparts."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "specifically"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "108590db-b218-4875-95ef-69fef481f14e",
                                "sense_id": "c609716a-fb6f-30d8-8ece-04431e2b7e92",
                                "text": "Our forces being landed and ſtationed as I have already mentioned, ſet about erecting a faſchine battery to cannonade the principal fort of the enemy, and in ſomething more than three vveeks, it vvas ready to open."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "caf73007-1638-4099-b1f7-866233c7e10f",
                                "sense_id": "c609716a-fb6f-30d8-8ece-04431e2b7e92",
                                "text": "Halberts differ very little from the bill, being like them conſtructed both for puſhing and cutting: a halbert conſiſts of three parts, the ſpear, or ſometimes a kind of ſvvord blade for puſhing, an ax, or hatchet for ſtriking and cutting, and a flook or hook for pulling down faſcines, in the attack of trenches, or temporary fortifications."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f61c298c-63f3-4737-b7e8-01335aa2dc7e",
                                "sense_id": "c609716a-fb6f-30d8-8ece-04431e2b7e92",
                                "text": "Verily the man must feel as though he were in a dream; only a short time before, at a shoemaker's ordinary work, the knocking of his hammer mingling with the sighs of a sick wife, and now, fascine knife on hip, helmet on closely cropped head, officers' commands in ear, crowds of people, drums, music, and the shrill whistle of the locomotive!—to march far away to Bohemia; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "711908c0-d136-3e43-890b-322c85272cfd",
                        "entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something which is used for defensive purposes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9a283b4-aadf-406f-ad22-64c21b44f8b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "33e6d6f5-549d-336f-9317-2fcfe742b9f1",
                        "source_sense_description": "cylindrical bundle of small sticks of wood bound together, used for strengthening purposes; (military fortification) similar bundle of sticks of wood or plastic pipes used for filling in ditches for armoured fighting vehicles to drive over, and for making parapets, raising batteries, and strengthening ramparts",
                        "target_lang_word": "fascine",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fascine",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb3027e5-ef25-34b3-912d-d74565bc8cee",
                                        "entry_id": "bf35ac5e-f186-3e8f-af00-9e61d18819ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fagot de petit bois."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3a715cc-79de-4184-856c-cb5f02496209",
                                                "sense_id": "bb3027e5-ef25-34b3-912d-d74565bc8cee",
                                                "text": "Le travail à exécuter était difficultueux, car les castors devaient, après les avoir rognées à la dimension convenable, traîner à travers la vase bûches et fascines. — (James Oliver Curwood, Kazan, 1914, traduit de l’anglais par P. Gruyer et L. Postif, Hachette, 1937, page 208)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                        "entry_id": "bf35ac5e-f186-3e8f-af00-9e61d18819ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fagot de branchages dont on se sert pour combler des fossés, réparer de mauvais chemins et faire des ouvrages de défense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cb6db4f-b805-47ee-b0d9-2cde7a037062",
                                                "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                                "text": "Au temps de Vercingétorix, trois enceintes de fascines et de terre battue, revêtues de pierres sèches, s’arrondissaient en amphithéâtre sur le flanc de la colline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4170058-aae9-40c8-8b67-da616f3e6269",
                                                "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                                "text": "On fait alors des puits d’un mètre de diamètre environ, cerclés par des fascines destinées à retenir les terres qui pourraient s’ébouler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef13896d-4949-453f-a4cb-7c3178b60427",
                                                "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                                "text": "La circulation dans des rigoles ouvertes, l’écoulement sur des fascines sont très efficace à cet égard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b0d2381-3b8b-4e33-aac6-d94ddd3e3ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                                "text": "La tranchée était plutôt bâtie que creusée, composée de sacs, de fascines et de claies, trop mince rempart que nous consolidions toutes les nuits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fc0a3f5-d8cc-4d85-a82a-cb4509a2130e",
                                                "sense_id": "af4fbf74-30be-31c8-a675-c77fee1fe475",
                                                "text": "Comme dans les Rhunes, les parois de la tranchée étaient retenues par des fascines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e84969d9-4b36-3c48-bc2e-ee76d51a6d54",
                                        "entry_id": "bf35ac5e-f186-3e8f-af00-9e61d18819ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Construction de fagots disposés à l’horizontale entre deux rangs de pieux, qui sert comme barrière ou pour empêcher l’érosion des berges d’un cours d'eau ou de ruissellement de surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6810190-79fd-3cd5-9d78-4ef1911c6dca",
                                        "entry_id": "bf35ac5e-f186-3e8f-af00-9e61d18819ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Assemblage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86716295-b2eb-4b75-9d7c-a1653598e0f4",
                                                "sense_id": "c6810190-79fd-3cd5-9d78-4ef1911c6dca",
                                                "text": "Des étudiants, des ouvriers couraient. Il passa devant des fascines de barbelés (à quoi ça pourrait-il servir ?), monta, contourna la mitrailleuse atteignit le palier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
